{"id":861,"slug":"white-dog","title":"White Dog","year":1982,"country":"United States","duration":90,"spine":455,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/861-white-dog","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/9ab62e3c84d1e425f22f1ef0faff4ce6/YtG4hSnlvfmbCB4iGsZzQOaXeaj8HA_large.jpg","description":"Samuel Fuller’s throat-grabbing exposé on American racism was misunderstood and withheld from release when it was made in the early eighties; today, the notorious film is lauded for its daring metaphor and gripping pulp filmmaking. Kristy McNichol stars as a young actress who adopts a lost German shepherd, only to discover through a series of horrifying incidents that the dog has been trained to attack black people, and Paul Winfield plays the animal trainer who tries to cure him. A snarling, uncompromising vision, White Dog is a tragic portrait of the evil done by that most corruptible of animals: the human being. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Samuel Fuller","slug":"samuel-fuller"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Kristy McNichol","role":"Julie Sawyer","slug":"kristy-mcnichol"},{"actor":"Paul Winfield","role":"Keys","slug":"paul-winfield"},{"actor":"Burl Ives","role":"Carruthers","slug":"burl-ives"},{"actor":"Jameson Parker","role":"Roland Gray","slug":"jameson-parker"},{"actor":"Lynne Moody","role":"Molly","slug":"lynne-moody"},{"actor":"Marshall Thompson","role":"Director","slug":"marshall-thompson"},{"actor":"Christa Lang","role":"Nurse","slug":"christa-lang"},{"actor":"Samuel Fuller","role":"Charlie Felton","slug":"samuel-fuller"},{"actor":"Hans","role":"Dogs","slug":"hans"},{"actor":"Folsom","role":null,"slug":"folsom"},{"actor":"Son","role":null,"slug":"son"},{"actor":"Buster","role":null,"slug":"buster"},{"actor":"Duke","role":null,"slug":"duke"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Samuel Fuller","slug":"samuel-fuller"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Jon Davison","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Samuel Fuller","slug":"samuel-full